              "content": "<table><tr><td>Time in seconds</td><td>Comparison to real-world events/phenomena</td></tr><tr><td><eq>1 0 ^ { 0 }   = 1</eq> second</td><td>Time taken for a ball thrown up to fall back on the ground (typically a few seconds).</td></tr><tr><td><eq>1 0 ^ { 1 } = 1 0</eq> seconds</td><td>Time blood takes to complete one full circulation <eq>( 1 \\times 1 0 ^ { 1 } - 2 \\times 1 0 ^ { 1 }</eq> through the body: 10-20 seconds seconds). Typical waiting time at a traffic signal.</td></tr></table>"
