              "content": "Isn’t it quite amazing how someone is able to estimate things like the number of ants in the world or the time blood takes to fully circulate? You may carry this wonder whenever you encounter such facts. You will come across such facts in subjects like Science and Social Science, where such estimates are made frequently."
